# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover / JetBrains
.idea/

# Project specific
/CLAUDE.md
/tests/output/*.pdf
/examples/rust_ffi_example/target/
/examples/pdf_example

# Dynamic libraries
*.dylib
*.so
*.dll

# Prebuilt Pdfium binaries fetched by scripts/fetch_pdfium.sh for local
# development/testing of the `render` feature. Never commit these: they are
# large per-platform native binaries bundled at *application* packaging
# time (see ARCHITECTURE.md), not part of this library's source.
/.pdfium/

# Rendered raster output produced by tests/render_tests.rs for manual
# visual inspection (PNG files, potentially large).
/tests/output/render/

# Test generated files are in tests/output/ and already ignored by /tests/output/*.pdf
# PEM files in tests/output/
/tests/output/*.pem
/rust-pdf-implementation-prompts.md
/rust-pdf-workflow.js